{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20747","headline":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 客谢竹 · 卢仝","name":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 客谢竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬州駮杂地，不辨龙𧈼蜴\n客身正乾枯，行处无膏泽。\n太山道不远，相庇实无力。\n君若随我行，必有煎茶厄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}